# legs/adult/loco/tips: shoe tips under a long hem (A3's woman): drawn over the hem's under-edge
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# Redrawn 2026-10-19 with the walk (std.pxm): both shoes show in every front and back frame (a step lifts one a row over
# the hem, never hides it); side views keep A3's flat tip (a 6 px shoe on a 7 px sole) with the planted sole centred on
# the plant anchor the man's legs use (round 2: one walk table for both bodies), a second shoe lifted behind the hem on
# the down frames, both off the ground in the run's flight; `stance` is A3's. Regions: B shoe, O sole (rags: bare feet).
use person woman
body adult
role legs tips
layer hangFront
anchor pivot
keys legs
z 9

